Administrative Procedure Act (APA)
SR 172.021 — Federal Act of 20 December 1968 on Administrative Procedure (Administrative Procedure Act, APA).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/1969/737_757_755]
