Preamble
The Federal Assembly of the Swiss Confederation,
on the basis of Article 103 of the Federal Constitution, and having considered the Dispatch of the Federal Council dated 24 September 1965,
decrees:
|

:NOTE
[BS 1 3]. This provision corresponds to Art. 177 para. 3 and 187 para. 1 let. d of the Federal Constitution of 18 April 1999 (SR 101).
